      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Merric.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 4 → CR 1 as a soldier. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Axe-Wielding Sheep Who Joined the Team Because Why Not</strong> — Shadow Estate escape party / new Disaster Inc.-linked ally</p><p>Status: Active — recruited during the Shadow Estate rooftop escape after calling Markop “Centerus”</p><p>Merric is an axe-wielding sheep encountered during the Shadow Estate sequence. He behaved as if he was already part of the team, then failed Markop's identity check by calling him “Centerus,” then accepted the correction not by apologizing but by joining the team for real. Waluigi respects this recruitment method because it is fast, confusing, and paperwork-light.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Axe</strong> — “The Axe-Wielding Sheep Who Joined the Team Because Why Not”</li><li><strong>Leadership</strong> — “Merric arrived behaving as though he had always been part of Disaster Inc., offered live commentary on Markop's fighting technique, and generally conducted himself with the serene confidence of someone who has never”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/merric</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/merric</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
